SUMMARY:Allies in Exile (BBC Storyville)
DESCRIPTION:From BBC Storyville\n\nA Storyville documentary that follows 
 Syrian film-makers Hasan Kattan and Fadi Al-Halabi. Having forged a frie
 ndship while living through\, and filming\, the war in Syria\, they now 
 face a very different reality as they navigate the UK asylum system.\n\n
 Turning the camera on themselves\, they document a new chapter in their 
 own lives shaped by uncertainty\, bureaucracy and displacement\, offerin
 g a deeply personal and very raw exploration of friendship and belonging
 . This heart-wrenching film offers an intimate perspective on life in ex
 ile and the enduring power of storytelling in the face of adversity.\n\n
 https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/36695/season/30/episode/14
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/36695/season/30/episode/14
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
