SUMMARY:Journey to the End of the Ego
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Alastair Lee\n\nThe scene is the almost mythical 
 landscape of Ben Loyal\, one of Scotland's most remote mountains towerin
 g over the Arctic Ocean. The cliff is one of the finest sweeps of clean 
 unclimbed rock to be found anywhere in the land. The climber is the thou
 ght-provoking controversial live-wire\, who goes by the name of Franco C
 ookson. This is the epic story of the UK's most dangerous trad route and
  the 105 days of climbing it took to realise one man's dream; 'Nothing i
 s Lost' E12 7a.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1803407
