SUMMARY:The Himalayas in My Heart
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Jérémy Bigé\n\nIn 1802\, the Survey of India I
 nstitute launched the Great Trigonometrical Survey\, a colossal undertak
 ing aimed at precisely mapping British India from which the world became
  aware of the vast scale of the Himalayan range. From August to November
  2024\, using these historical maps\, Jérémy Bigé makes his way on fo
 ot over 2\,300km from Indian Kashmir to central Nepal. His goal: to conn
 ect the various Himalayan cultures in a single journey by following rout
 es from the past.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1810492
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1810492
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
