SUMMARY:À bord du vide
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Thomas Guerrin\n\nA poetic exploration of the art
  of steep skiing with Aurélien Lardy. This film celebrates the art of t
 he movement\, the commitment\, and the intimate relationship between the
  man and the mountain\, and what draws us to vertical places.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.themoviedb.org/movie/1806288
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1806288
