SUMMARY:It Takes Two To Tandem
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Cat Aeppel\n\nLongtime riding partners Sam and Ja
 zz take a tandem bike across some of their favourite trails in the Rocki
 es\, marking ten years since their first tandem adventure together. Part
  celebration\, part reflection\, the film explores friendship\, trust\, 
 and the rare joy of moving through the world in sync.\n\nhttps://www.the
 moviedb.org/movie/1810954
