SUMMARY:More than Everest: The Life of T.H. Somervell
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Simon Pierse\n\nT. Howard Somervell (1890-1975) i
 s best known for his role in the 1922 and 1924 expeditions to climb Ever
 est. This film explores the lesser known aspects of Somervell's remarkab
 le life as a missionary surgeon\, artist and composer of music.\n\nhttps
 ://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1812068
