SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Nathan Fielder\n\nThirty-four days before she's s
 ent to prison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invite
 s a skeptical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an in
 timate portrait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year 
 journey into the abyss.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1765072
