SUMMARY:American Doctor
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Poh Si Teng\n\nUnited by a shared oath to save li
 ves\, three American doctors—Palestinian\, Jewish\, and Zoroastrian—
 work in a besieged hospital in Gaza in the middle of a genocide comitted
  by Israel\, and return to the United States to fight for the patients a
 nd colleagues they left behind.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1596
 332
