SUMMARY:Bloomin' Octopus!
DESCRIPTION:Directed by David Palfrey\n\nExplores the sudden rise in octo
 pus numbers in south west England through a series of interconnected per
 spectives\, showing how shifts beneath the surface ripple outward\, affe
 cting ecosystems and people alike.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1
 807466
