DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:75 Seconds
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Marco Tribelhorn\n\nOn a foggy March evening in N
 orway\, freeskier Jacob Wester triggers an avalanche and is swept off a 
 cliff. For 75 seconds\, he fights for his life inside a roaring mass of 
 snow\, while his wife Sofia waits in silence below. This is an account o
 f chaos\, fear\, and hope inside an avalanche.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb
 .org/movie/1805666
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1805666
