SUMMARY:Dreamrime
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Alastair Lee\n\nSit back and marvel at this cinem
 atic wonder as we see the famous Cerro Torre towers of Patagonia like ne
 ver before. Filmed by local drone expert Ty Lekki and produced by multi-
 award winner Alastair Lee\, this film is a glorious marriage of sound an
 d vision as we enter a new phase of mountain film making. A team of thre
 e Argentinian and one German Alpinists attempt the Punta Hernon/Torre Eg
 ger traverse\, encountering the unique rime and mushroom formations foun
 d only in this special part of the world.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/
 movie/1803403
