DESCRIPTION:Directed by Neil Losin\n\nSix-year old Aldo spends an excitin
 g weekend banding migrating raptors in Cape May\, New Jersey with his fr
 iend John\, a volunteer bander with the Cape May Raptor Banding Project.
 \n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1806591
