 d\, un-ridden waves rolling into secret golden beaches\, and local chara
 cters to greet you with a smile\, six professional athletes make the mos
 t of every moment during an action-packed adventure through Aotearoa\, N
 Z!\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1813716
