SUMMARY:Forward
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Nic Collar\n\nCelebrate the power of adaptive adv
 enture through the inspiring journey of Clay March — a young man with 
 cerebral palsy whose passion for skiing\, surfing\, and exploring the ou
 tdoors knows no bounds. Set against the awe-inspiring landscapes of Brit
 ish Columbia\, Clay\, his triplet brother Tanner\, and a vibrant cast of
  renowned adaptive athletes set out to defy expectations and redefine wh
 at inclusion in the outdoors truly means.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/
 movie/1809124
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1809124
