DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:Ripple
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Ryder Schwartz\n\nTwo women sit by the lake that 
 raised them and have a conversation about what it means to be a freeride
  skier. After dedicating their lives to the sport\, they question the me
 aning of it all. More than anything\, this is a story about surrendering
  to the present moment. A story about being water.\n\nhttps://www.themov
 iedb.org/movie/1813610
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1813610
