DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:Folk Who Roam
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Emma Crome\n\nSheffield-based violin maker Emma H
 ardy is bridging the gap between nature and music by designing and hand-
 crafting a uniquely decorated violin inspired by the Peak District’s h
 istory of folk music and land access rights.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.o
 rg/movie/1808451
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1808451
