SUMMARY:Chuey
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Sami Kimberley\n\nSince moving from Malaysia to L
 ondon in the 1970s\, Malaysian-Chinese Buddhist and therapist Chuey has 
 transformed the garden of her family home into a sanctuary of global flo
 ra; blending plants from across continents\, her garden and personal sto
 ry entwine in quiet narratives of migration\, memory\, and finding belon
 ging. Set in the suburbs of North-West London as summer winds down\, thi
 s meditative short invites us into her intimate reflections\, offering a
  story of resilience\, unity\, and nature's power to dissolve barriers.
  \n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1808066
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1808066
