SUMMARY:Not Just Running
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Joel Badia Vila\n\nAn intimate portrait of an ath
 lete who finds in movement a way to understand herself\, grow\, and cont
 inue shaping her own path. Through her preparation\, training sessions\,
  and the quiet moments that come before competition\, the film approache
 s Joyce Njeru not only as an elite runner\, but as a person shaped by he
 r culture\, determination\, discipline\, and a deep connection with the 
 terrain.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1812678
