DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:The Lost Cache
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Todd Jones\n\nHistory\, science and exploration c
 onverged in a quest to find the lost camera of one of climbing’s most 
 iconic photographers and cartographers\, Bradford Washburn. Set against 
 the backdrop of the pioneering lensmen’s storied 1937 Mount Lucania ex
 pedition\, this film blurs the lines between adventure documentary\, tre
 asure hunt and meditation on why we risk everything to chase the improba
 ble.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1786136
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1786136
